      "id": 475113,
      "username": "rydupvc",
      "name": "",
      "created_at": "2025-07-23T08:58:45.996Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hello everyone, I am a beginner to ERPNext. I would like to ask you to help me recommend the hardware configuration of a server. I am a pharmaceutical machinery manufacturing factory, and I only need to use the functions of purchasing, sales, production, and HR. There are about 200 employees, and there are 50,000 different types of parts in the warehouse to manage. I’m thinking about building a stable, high-speed server myself. Do you have friends who can give good advice? Thank you!</p>",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/r/c67d28/{size}.png",
      "trust_level": 1,
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
