    {
      "id": 475129,
      "username": "revant_one",
      "name": "Revant Nandgaonkar",
      "created_at": "2025-07-23T11:08:50.730Z",
      "cooked": "<ul>\n<li>If you are going for bare-metal setup, buy the best thing you can afford. Capacity, redundancy, storage, backups, networking, fire safety, power backups, etc. It is time-consuming and takes lot of downtime to upgrade bare-metal servers.</li>\n<li>If you are going with cloud providers, start with 2CPU, 4GB RAM VM and upgrade as needed, it will upgrade with click of a button with least downtime and no screwdriver needed. Frappecloud being one of the cloud provider you can start with their base plans and then upgrade as you need.</li>\n</ul>",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discuss.frappe.io/revant_one/{size}/55081_2.png",
