      "id": 475207,
      "username": "volkswagner",
      "name": "volkswagner",
      "created_at": "2025-07-24T11:11:21.087Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Even if you are building a server, you should strongly consider virtualization. Virtual Machines are easier to backup and restore. Virtualization also allows you to have multiple servers running on a single host. This allows you to have testing, deployment, and production servers.</p>",
